CulturePersona-Seoul
Copyright (c) 2026 The CulturePersona-Seoul authors

Data: the grounding tables, sampler specifications, open-item theme tables and codebook, and the synthetic
personas with their narratives are released under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
International licence (CC BY-NC 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Code and evaluation layer: the code (src/, scripts/, tests/, preprocessing/, annotation/, paper/) and the
evaluation layer (held-out item registry, SSR reference statements, model answers, PPI and score tables,
model-judge runs, audit guideline and aggregate audit results) are released under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Persona records and table values that appear inside the evaluation layer remain under CC BY-NC 4.0.

Source data: Seoul Citizens' Cultural Participation Survey, 2020, 2022 and 2024 waves (Seoul Foundation for
Arts and Culture; reports published 2021, 2023 and 2025). Users of the data must cite this source.
The survey microdata are not included and are not redistributed.

The data describe synthetic residents grounded in weighted estimates of an online panel of Seoul residents,
not the Seoul population. This resource is not an official statistic or product of the Seoul Foundation for
Arts and Culture and implies no approval or endorsement by it.
